{"id":"632177","name":"紫薯小丸子","author":"沐祠姐姐","authorId":"12934813","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/632177/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"紫薯","amount":"200克"},{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"100克"},{"name":"白砂糖","amount":"50克"}],"sub":[{"name":"芝麻","amount":"适量"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"大量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"水磨糯米粉。","img":"images/632177/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"紫薯切成小块放在锅里蒸熟。","img":"images/632177/step_2.jpeg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒸熟的紫薯用勺子压成泥。","img":"images/632177/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入糯米粉和白砂糖。","img":"images/632177/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加少许的水搅拌均匀。","img":"images/632177/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"用手揉成这样。","img":"images/632177/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搓成小丸子。","img":"images/632177/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"搓成差不多大小，然后锅中放油。","img":"images/632177/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"把丸子放进去炸。","img":"images/632177/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"炸好的丸子直接放入芝麻里滚几下。","img":"images/632177/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/632177/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"香糯甜甜。","img":"images/632177/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"好好吃的样子。","img":"images/632177/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}